If a patient takes a prescribed-medication then every clinician should review the prescribed-medication during a prepregnancy-care for the patient and should review the prescribed-medication during an interpregnancy-care for the patient.
If a patient takes a nonprescribed-medication then every clinician should review the nonprescribed-medication during a prepregnancy-care for the patient and should review the nonprescribed-medication during an interpregnancy-care for the patient.
